From: BC250 FSR4 maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] upscalers: opt-in pinned local manifest with strict integrity

Base: GE-Proton11-6 protonfixes/upscalers.py
Base-SHA256: 4128896c4134d865a290e2e8e62279d07157131b207f4bc7d29e8c873fe85645

PROTON_UPSCALER_MANIFEST selects an absolute local JSON manifest using the
existing schema plus mandatory archive and critical-file SHA256 checksums.
Local archives are read directly, with relative paths confined to the manifest
directory. Requested artifacts are validated before prefix payload writes. Exact requests
never select another version, and local-mode failures stop the launch.
Stock behavior is retained when the variable is absent.

--- a/protonfixes/upscalers.py
+++ b/protonfixes/upscalers.py
